},"isAutomated":false,"automatedBy":null},"extendedEntities":{},"card":null,"place":{},"entities":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"1421328887330582528","indices":[0,12],"name":"Gappy (Giuseppe Paleologo)","screen_name":"__paleologo"}]},"quoted_tweet":null,"retweeted_tweet":null,"isLimitedReply":false,"communityInfo":null,"article":null},{"type":"tweet","id":"2048432029214101681","url":"https://x.com/GrantStenger/status/2048432029214101681","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/GrantStenger/status/2048432029214101681","text":"@MaxResnick Oh and two non-adjacent pairs cross with probability 1/3 because, if the chords are AB and CD, fixing A as the start and naming the vertices cyclically, the only possible orders are: ABCD, ABDC, ACBD, ACDB, ADBC, or ADCB. Only 2 of the 6 cross, namely ACBD and ADBC, so the probability of being in one of those crossing configurations is 1/3.","source":"Twitter for iPhone","retweetCount":0,"replyCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"viewCount":204,"createdAt":"Sun Apr 26 16:00:28 +0000 2026","lang":"en","bookmarkCount":1,"isReply":true,"inReplyToId":"2048430269883887695","conversationId":"2048409488051335257","displayTextRange":[12,285],"inReplyToUserId":"2347612712","inReplyToUsername":"GrantStenger","author":{"type":"user","userName":"GrantStenger","url":"https://x.com/GrantStenger","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/GrantStenger","id":"2347612712","name":"Grant Stenger (hiring)","isVerified":false,"isBlueVerified":true,"verifiedType":null,"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1740635145911279616/AVV7Y4eE_normal.jpg","coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2347612712/1749081802","description":"","location":"NYC / SF","followers":13607,"following":6277,"status":"","canDm":true,"canMediaTag":false,"createdAt":"Mon Feb 17 00:00:01 +0000 2014","entities":{"description":{"urls":[]},"url":{}},"fastFollowersCount":0,"favouritesCount":110309,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"isTranslator":false,"mediaCount":187,"statusesCount":2259,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{},"possiblySensitive":false,"pinnedTweetIds":[],"profile_bio":{"description":"Kinetic CEO | prev @janestreetgroup @polychain @numerai","entities":{"description":{"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"","indices":[19,35],"name":"","screen_name":"janestreetgroup"},{"id_str":"","indices":[36,46],"name":"","screen_name":"polychain"},{"id_str":"","indices":[47,55],"name":"","screen_name":"numerai"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"grantstenger.com","expanded_url":"https://www.grantstenger.com/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/iXxNQpGsaJ"}]}}},"isAutomated":false,"automatedBy":null},"extendedEntities":{},"card":null,"place":{},"entities":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"quoted_tweet":null,"retweeted_tweet":null,"isLimitedReply":false,"communityInfo":null,"article":null},{"type":"tweet","id":"2048430269883887695","url":"https://x.com/GrantStenger/status/2048430269883887695","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/GrantStenger/status/2048430269883887695","text":"@MaxResnick Let E_[n] be the expected number of crossings of the chain P_1 P_2, P_2 P_3, ..., P_[n-1] P_n formed from n random points on the circle.

When we add a new point P_n, we introduce a new chord P_[n-1] P_n. This new chord can't cross the immediately previous chord P_[n-2] P_[n-1] because they share the endpoint P_[n-1], so there are n-3 chords it can cross (given n>=3). 

Each chord is generated from random points on the circle (side stepping Bertrand's Paradox specification issues), so two chords who share no endpoints cross with probability 1/3.

Therefore the expected number of new crossings introduced when adding P_n is (n-3)/3. So, E_n = E_[n-1] + (n-3)/3, and generally E_n = (n-2)(n-3)/6. So E_10 = 28/3. 

Can also just count the number of non-adjacent chord pairs, so (9 choose 2) total pairs minus 8 adjacent pairs = 28. And by linearity of expectation E_10 = 1/3 * 28 = 28/3.","source":"Twitter for iPhone","retweetCount":0,"replyCount":1,"likeCount":8,"quoteCount":0,"viewCount":700,"createdAt":"Sun Apr 26 15:53:28 +0000 2026","lang":"en","bookmarkCount":1,"isReply":true,"inReplyToId":"2048409488051335257","conversationId":"2048409488051335257","displayTextRange":[12,290],"inReplyToUserId":"1275877058342682633","inReplyToUsername":"MaxResnick","author":{"type":"user","userName":"GrantStenger","url":"https://x.com/GrantStenger","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/GrantStenger","id":"2347612712","name":"Grant Stenger (hiring)","isVerified":false,"isBlueVerified":true,"verifiedType":null,"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1740635145911279616/AVV7Y4eE_normal.jpg","coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2347612712/1749081802","description":"","location":"NYC / SF","followers":13607,"following":6277,"status":"","canDm":true,"canMediaTag":false,"createdAt":"Mon Feb 17 00:00:01 +0000 2014","entities":{"description":{"urls":[]},"url":{}},"fastFollowersCount":0,"favouritesCount":110309,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"isTranslator":false,"mediaCount":187,"statusesCount":2259,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{},"possiblySensitive":false,"pinnedTweetIds":[],"profile_bio":{"description":"Kinetic CEO | prev @janestreetgroup @polychain @numerai","entities":{"description":{"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"","indices":[19,35],"name":"","screen_name":"janestreetgroup"},{"id_str":"","indices":[36,46],"name":"","screen_name":"polychain"},{"id_str":"","indices":[47,55],"name":"","screen_name":"numerai"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"grantstenger.com","expanded_url":"https://www.grantstenger.com/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/iXxNQpGsaJ"}]}}},"isAutomated":false,"automatedBy":null},"extendedEntities":{},"card":null,"place":{},"entities":{